# `npm run capture:*` output (screenshots + measurements).
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `screens/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, and it was silently swallowing
# `src/ui/screens/` — the play screen would have been left out of its own
# commit with no warning (caught in T3.2 by `git check-ignore`).
/screens/
*.local
